WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.180
He's a kidnapper!

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:06.460
Please help us apprehend the criminal!

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:08.230
You're the kidnapper!

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:14.400
What do you mean I died
in the incident six years ago?

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:17.870
Someone brought you back to
life with summoning magic.

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:18.870
Summoning?

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:20.490
You'll understand if you come with me.

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:21.760
No!

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:24.620
Give me a reason to trust you, Sameoka!

00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:27.130
...We're...

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:50.440
Shizumu!

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:51.940
Let's go!

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:59.370
Sameoka, just tell me!

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:05.320
Shizumu!

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:05.910
No!

00:01:06.350 --> 00:01:07.290
Cecil!

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:15.630
Shizumu!

00:01:19.170 --> 00:01:21.100
Cecil, come here!

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:27.440
Sameoka!

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:29.850
<i>What is this?</i>

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:34.640
<i>What on Earth is happening?</i>

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:43.320
Moyoyon!

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:50.830
I will carry my indomitable hope into the dark night

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:50.830
yami no naka no shinjitsu ga hikari kagayaku you ni

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:57.100
so that it may light a shining fire of truth there

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:57.100
kagi no nai kibou wo tokihanatou

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:12.990
I was born bleeding from my hands,

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:12.990
naze te no hira no kizu wo daite umareochita imi

00:02:12.990 --> 00:02:16.610
and why was I born not a thousand years in the past or the future,

00:02:12.990 --> 00:02:16.610
sennen kako demo mirai demo naku

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:18.070
but in the present?

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:18.070
erabareta ima

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:22.120
The scales of justice are fragile

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:22.120
zen'aku hakaru tenbin wa zeijaku

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:27.500
The waning, waxing moon calls to a flower on the earth

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:27.500
michikakeru tsuki ga izanau gisei no chi ni saita

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.250
the color of blood

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.250
chi no iro no hana

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:31.730
I will give all I have

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:31.730
tatta hitotsu kanau nara

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:34.430
if it means one of my wishes will come true

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:34.430
subete wo sasageyou

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:37.590
I have a "post nubila phoebus" kind of personality

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:37.590
post nubila phoebus kokoro

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:39.590
which I will show the world

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:39.590
kaze ni hanate

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:42.560
I want to slash apart the curtain of raven black,

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:42.560
shikkoku no curtain hikichigiri

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:45.250
and look at a new world

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:45.250
chigau sora wo mitemitai

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:47.920
I put my love into the cracks

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:47.920
sabita unmei no hibiware

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:50.390
of a stagnant fate

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:50.390
omoi wo nejikonde

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:53.250
No matter how long the storm lasts,

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:53.250
donnani arasoi tsuzuketemo

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:55.860
time itself will not stop breathing

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:55.860
toki wa kokyuu wo yamenai

00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:58.620
What remains after destruction, rebirth,

00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:58.620
kowashite tsunde kowashite

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:01.090
and further destruction?

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:01.090
nani ga nokoru darou

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:03.820
I'm sure the starlit sky can put an end

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:03.820
sou nanajuuoku mo no mayoi hoshi

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:06.960
to the system of the world

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:06.960
sono haichizu wa kakikaerareru

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:09.580
I'm sure that one day I will find a place where I can shine

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:09.580
moetsukitemo kagayakeru basho he

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:13.870
even if only ashes will remain

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:13.870
itsuka tadoritsukeru

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:20.210
Imposters

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:20.210
Case 10

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:23.160
It's me.

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:24.590
I'm very sorry.

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:26.590
There was an unexpected nuisance.

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:29.600
Who was it?

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:33.730
The senior partner of Shark Knight
Law Offices, Sameoka Kiba.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:37.200
...Of course it'd be a dog of Labone...

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:43.070
Hurry and obtain the catalyst
for the sake of the plan.

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:45.280
Don't disappoint me.

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:47.640
Yes, sir.

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:55.980
Let's stay here till we have to go to work.

00:03:59.270 --> 00:04:00.760
Are you okay?

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:03.920
...Moyoyon...

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:05.590
Hm?

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:11.520
...I'm irritated...

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:16.290
You need to calm down.
Cecil isn't a child.

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:17.240
Yeah.

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:20.700
I'm sure there's a reason
she hasn't come home yet.

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:24.430
What kind of reason would that be?

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:28.570
Unforgivable! Curse you, Shizumu!

00:04:28.570 --> 00:04:31.720
A familiar is supposed to
protect their master.

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:34.840
Now look at what's happened.
How pathetic.

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:40.020
<i>My master, Hotaru,
would never cause such trouble.</i>

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:41.590
Cecil's such a bother.

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:46.340
I'm sure Cecil is fine.

00:04:47.030 --> 00:04:49.600
Bubuhii, you're so nice.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.850
...And yet, Kokkii and Nyanyai are...

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:54.600
I haven't said anything wrong.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:57.360
That's right! Cecil's still a kid.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:58.460
Anger.

00:04:58.460 --> 00:04:59.850
What?!

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:02.860
Shark Knight's Sameoka was arrested?

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.860
Yes.. They just asked us to represent him.

00:05:06.310 --> 00:05:06.990
What's the charge?

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:10.220
We won't know until we interview him.

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:12.320
But he was caught red-handed
causing property damage.

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:15.490
However, they say the police
are after something else.

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:19.240
At any rate, let's hear
what Sameoka has to say.

00:05:19.240 --> 00:05:19.840
Yeah.

00:05:23.310 --> 00:05:25.250
How dare you get in my way?

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:28.380
Let me go.

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:32.720
If you don't, I might
have to spill your secret.

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:37.180
Currently, you're a suspect.

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:40.440
No one's going to listen to a criminal.

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:43.860
Do a premises search at Shark Knight?

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:47.100
He's suspected of human trafficking.

00:05:47.100 --> 00:05:48.860
Last month, he went to Canada.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:51.860
It's possible he was meeting a broker.

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:52.870
State of Investigation Report

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:54.370
Is this urgent?

00:05:55.190 --> 00:05:57.640
There'll be no point in this
if they destroy the evidence.

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:59.620
I want you to make the
final decision as my superior.

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:02.630
What are you plotting?

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:07.470
You've been acting real suspicious lately.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:11.220
Killing every suspect, being a no-show
at crime scenes without permission,

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:13.280
...obsessing over Sudou Cecil...

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:14.720
What the hell's going on?!

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:18.680
Sameoka tried to kidnap Cecil!

00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:19.890
Please approve this already!

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:21.160
Don't try to fool me!

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:23.080
You're feigning ignorance?

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:24.900
I'm reporting this to the
inspector of internal affairs.

00:06:27.270 --> 00:06:30.270
I'll explain everything afterward.

00:06:30.270 --> 00:06:31.400
Will that work?

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:33.910
You promise?

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:38.660
What do you mean
we can't interview him?

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:40.000
That's unbelievable!

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.980
We have the right.

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:44.740
The police have no right to interfere.

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:48.180
These orders come
from above. Please leave.

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:49.320
...But...

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:51.000
Inspector Quinn!

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:54.440
Is this your doing?

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:56.180
What are you talking about?

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:58.780
We're unable to interview Sameoka.

00:06:58.780 --> 00:07:00.930
We'll have to protest this to the Court.
Are you okay with that?

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:06.260
I'll look into this
and handle it accordingly.

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:09.390
More importantly, where is Sudou Cecil?

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:11.240
She's been missing all morning.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:12.490
What?

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:15.240
...So that's what happened...

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:18.540
What Sameoka
was saying was too abrupt,

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:23.160
and there aren't many wizards
...who can use summoning magic...

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:27.750
Summoning magic calls forth something
from the Demon World, doesn't it?

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:28.980
...Yeah...

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:33.010
But I've never heard of it
being used to resurrect the dead.

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:36.010
That's quite a magical power.

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:38.400
It's the most forbidden magic.

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:39.780
...I see...

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:44.200
But some things came to mind
...when Sameoka said that...

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:47.720
...When we were in Canada...

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:53.440
I was told the incident six years ago
was a plot to awaken my magic.

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:58.160
If I really died six years ago,

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:00.430
then why was I brought back to life?

00:08:00.430 --> 00:08:03.180
And why does Sameoka know that?

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:08.620
...And Shizumu is a Wud...

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:14.430
Ugh! There's so much going on,
my brain's gonna explode!

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:15.800
...There, there...

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:20.300
So, Cecillun, what did
being dead feel like?

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:21.160
Huh?

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:23.680
Was it sort of floaty?

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:27.180
Or were you able to see something?

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:33.460
I'm sorry. I don't really remember
anything from back then.

00:08:33.970 --> 00:08:35.690
Oh, that's too bad.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:41.700
This is Moyo.

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:44.440
Yeah, she's with me right now.

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:47.260
Okay, I'll bring her over.

00:08:49.030 --> 00:08:52.340
That was Ageha.
She's worried about you.

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:54.090
She said you weren't
answering your phone.

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:54.980
Huh?

00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:59.360
...Oh, the battery...

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:04.680
I totally cried watching
...<i>Agurangers yesterday...</i>

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:06.860
I can't believe you like that stuff.

00:09:06.860 --> 00:09:09.980
If you don't stop being a sentai otaku,
you won't get a boyfriend.

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:14.240
I'll find someone who's interested
in the same things as me.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:18.820
Besides, I don't have guys
on my mind 24/7 like you, Sasorin.

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:21.120
Hey, there's nothing wrong with that.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:23.060
Bring on the men!

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:27.880
Was there an incident?

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:28.870
I wonder.

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:32.130
Protect Sudou Cecil!

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:32.130
Kiba

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:33.640
...Two hours ago...

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:36.980
Why would you run off
on your own to play the hero?

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:43.660
As of 9:36 AM, the Metropolitan
Police Department's Investigation Division 1,

00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:49.140
Wud Homicide Investigations Unit 15 will be conducting
a premises search of Shark Knight Law Offices.

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:51.220
What's this all about?

00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:52.150
Do you have a warrant?

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:55.780
The charges are violations of the
magic-prohibition law, article 1.

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:58.480
We've already arrested
your chief, Sameoka Kiba.

00:09:58.480 --> 00:10:01.280
This matter is of utmost importance
due to the destruction of evidence.

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:03.020
We don't need a warrant.

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:03.990
...What are you...

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:07.520
There is suspicion that you are
secretly running a human trafficking ring.

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:08.870
We'll be taking a look.

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.960
You've got some nerve!

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:12.520
Stop, Sachi.

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:15.250
Anyway, without a warrant,
we can't comply.

00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:16.720
You'll oppose us?

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:19.010
Then we'll just have to
take you in, as well.

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:21.510
Just go ahead and try!

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:23.840
...Well, well...

00:10:24.510 --> 00:10:27.180
I was wondering what
...all the ruckus was about...

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:29.180
You're coming with us too.

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:31.600
Sure, whatever.

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:32.980
Hold it!

00:10:41.860 --> 00:10:43.140
...Why, you...

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:44.530
Shizumu!

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:50.370
Shizumu! What the hell are you doing?!

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:52.940
Firing a weapon without warning?

00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:55.840
Not to mention at a civilian
who hasn't even been charged yet!

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:57.380
Tell me this second!

00:10:57.380 --> 00:11:01.770
Wow. You're pretty nice today,
despite their being Wuds.

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:03.130
...What...

00:11:07.090 --> 00:11:09.100
You're a wizard?

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.670
I can't stand your prejudice
and insults against Wuds.

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:15.610
But for now, I want you out of my way.

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:19.620
If you can shoot, go for it.

00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:34.650
If only you were more thickheaded.

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:44.610
Am I going to die on my lucky day?

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:49.060
Cecil!

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:52.700
I was wondering where you went!

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:54.740
I was worried, bo-bo-bo-boing!

00:11:52.950 --> 00:11:55.940
Get a clue, you pervy frog!

00:11:57.410 --> 00:11:59.020
Get off her!

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:02.440
How long do you plan on
fondling Cecilcchi's boobs?

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:07.380
Thank goodness you're okay.

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:10.910
...Yeah. Moyoyon saved me...

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:15.420
Seriously, though, what are Sameoka
and Assistant Inspector Shizumu thinking?

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:18.920
Does that mean the enemy's
someone we know?

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:23.500
Inspector Quinn issued a subpoena,
but you don't have to go.

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:25.940
It's revenge for what they
did to us with Sameoka's case.

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:28.930
Yeah. We'll have to figure out
what's going on.

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:33.950
...I'm sorry to involve everyone...

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:34.800
...Sudou...

00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:37.440
There must be a reason for all this.

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:42.620
...I don't understand a lot of it, either...

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:46.450
That was pretty surprising.

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:51.600
To think Sudou Cecil would
come back after all these years.

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:57.010
She came to ask about
the trial six years ago.

00:12:57.010 --> 00:12:58.460
Has she figured it out?

00:12:58.460 --> 00:12:59.740
Oh, I doubt it.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:02.960
That's impossible.
Right, Director Makusu?

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:06.200
There is no problem at all.

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:09.970
No one will ever find out
about the irregularities in that trial.

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:12.440
Thank goodness.

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:15.320
I'm very grateful to you, Director Makusu.

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:18.240
Thanks to you, I was able to
become head prosecutor.

00:13:18.240 --> 00:13:19.480
...The same goes for you two...

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:20.840
Yeah.

00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:25.480
You provided the start-up capital
for my business. Right, Mr. Shindaiji?

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:28.720
I was granted a professorship, as well.

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:32.070
For that, I am eternally grateful.

00:13:32.070 --> 00:13:32.990
...However...

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:38.250
I believe it's a bit risky
to keep hiding this.

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:44.990
This is everything I know
about the case six years ago.

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:48.800
I'm sorry for keeping
...all of this a secret...

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:51.630
...And for endangering you all in Boston...

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:53.860
I'm very sorry.

00:13:53.860 --> 00:13:56.440
There's no reason for you
to apologize, Cecilcchi.

00:13:56.440 --> 00:14:01.020
Yeah. Those bad guys are
the ones who tried to use you.

00:14:04.770 --> 00:14:07.030
It must have been rough.

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:10.530
We'll do everything we can to help, okay?

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:12.460
...Thank you...

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:19.320
It would appear that the reason for
Sameoka's arrest involves Sudou, as well.

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:20.560
...And...

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:24.440
Why does Sameoka know about this?

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:28.050
Not to mention that the search of
Shark Knight's office is a bit odd.

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:31.060
I wonder who's behind all this.

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:33.380
What are they after?

00:14:33.800 --> 00:14:35.800
Do you want me to try divination?

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:37.060
Huh?

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:42.520
We might at least learn
what those responsible are after.

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:51.820
There's no time.

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:53.820
Yes, I know.

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:57.830
Conduct a search of premises
at Butterfly Law Offices.

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:00.840
We'll be able to easily
obtain the catalyst that way.

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:02.840
Um... Father?

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:03.840
What?

00:15:04.740 --> 00:15:08.630
After summoning magic
is used to bring forth Lucifer,

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:10.850
what will happen to the catalyst?

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:15.230
This is the first time in Wud history
that something like this will occur.

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:18.990
There's no way of telling
what will happen.

00:15:18.990 --> 00:15:19.920
...However...

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:24.100
The catalyst will no longer be human.

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:30.400
By using the catalyst as an offering,
we'll be able to control Lucifer's power.

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:34.760
No matter what, we must
find the catalyst and offer her.

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:35.610
...Cecil...

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:37.620
Capture her immediately.

00:15:39.010 --> 00:15:40.620
Do you understand, Shizumu?

00:15:41.850 --> 00:15:42.840
Yes, sir.

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:47.540
You forgot something.

00:15:57.150 --> 00:15:58.620
It doesn't suit you.

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:08.760
It looks delicious! Pork bone ramen!

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:12.360
I haven't eaten anything since this morning, so I'm starving!

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:13.960
Thanks, Natcchi!

00:16:13.960 --> 00:16:18.520
Well, it's just because I was
hungry and wanted to eat it.

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:20.000
I'm not going out of my way.

00:16:20.530 --> 00:16:21.940
Such rich broth,

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:25.700
with perfectly cooked noodles, and the ingredients
are mostly vegetables and well-balanced.

00:16:25.700 --> 00:16:28.100
Excellent work.

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:30.540
I have a lot of girl-power.

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:33.520
I'm so blessed.

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:36.800
...Everyone's helping me so much...

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:38.550
I'm so happy.

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:42.560
I'll have to repay everyone one day.

00:16:43.740 --> 00:16:46.050
First, you have to become
a full-fledged barrister.

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:51.710
It's all about give-and-take.

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:53.120
Even if you don't want to,

00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:56.280
there'll come a time when you'll
have to do your best for someone else.

00:16:56.930 --> 00:16:57.840
Yeah.

00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:10.640
Who is it?

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:19.180
Director Makusu.

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:30.880
Greed knows no bounds.

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:33.540
Your role has come to an end.

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:47.350
Come to Ueno Park alone
without telling anyone.

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:52.080
I'll tell you why we were
trying to get hold of you.

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:56.060
...<i>If I can find out even a little...</i>

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:06.430
Over here.

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:22.540
Shark Knight is an organization
that was created to protect you.

00:18:22.540 --> 00:18:23.410
Huh?

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:29.560
Did you know that Wuds were originally divided
into two factions called "Macal" and "Labone"?

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:34.320
No. Though I've heard
the word "Macal" before.

00:18:34.870 --> 00:18:36.740
We are Labone.

00:18:39.770 --> 00:18:44.430
The Macal hate humans,
and plan their demise.

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:49.430
We, the Labone, want to live with humans,
so we've been opposing them.

00:18:50.030 --> 00:18:53.100
Over the years, our battles intensified,

00:18:53.100 --> 00:18:56.580
but then the humans put together
the magic-prohibition law,

00:18:56.580 --> 00:18:58.960
and for a moment, it seemed
everything had calmed down.

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:00.020
...But...

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:02.950
Beneath the surface,
Macal's ambitions continued.

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:06.460
Macal's attempting to
obtain an even greater power.

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:11.650
Grimoire 365 records
Wud history and prophecies.

00:19:11.650 --> 00:19:17.140
It's written that there's a wizard with extraordinary magic
...who only appears once every few hundred years...

00:19:17.530 --> 00:19:21.950
Macal wants to use that wizard.

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:24.470
...And that wizard is...

00:19:25.150 --> 00:19:27.220
...you, Cecil....

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:29.580
Huh? Me?

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:33.260
Macal forced you into dangerous situations

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:35.730
in order to awaken your dormant powers.

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:37.360
That rings a bell, doesn't it?

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:54.460
I was told if I could draw
...your dormant magic out...

00:19:55.280 --> 00:19:57.910
But why?

00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:03.400
They're preparing something
...to take over human society, but...

00:20:04.070 --> 00:20:07.730
We don't know exactly
how you're involved.

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:10.070
...I see...

00:20:10.070 --> 00:20:15.160
And one of Macal's leaders is Ekusou Shizumu,
who works for the police department.

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:15.860
Huh?

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:18.860
Someone is controlling
Shizumu from the shadows,

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:21.920
but we don't know who that is it.

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:24.860
...Shizumu is in Macal...

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:29.950
No matter what, you can't trust him.

00:20:34.770 --> 00:20:37.320
I'll regroup with my comrades
and come up with a plan.

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:42.520
We won't hand you over to Macal.

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:45.720
Don't worry. We'll protect you,
no matter what.

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:48.950
Cecil?

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:51.220
Cecillun!

00:20:53.470 --> 00:20:56.270
...Sorry, I have to go. Oh, and...

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:59.440
Be careful with Tentou Moyo.

00:21:00.060 --> 00:21:00.980
Huh?

00:21:01.450 --> 00:21:02.480
Hey!

00:21:04.970 --> 00:21:05.990
What are you doing?

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:08.360
Don't you realize
you're being targeted?

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:12.620
Next time you act without telling anyone, there won't
be any pervy massages or pervy lunches for you.

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:14.370
Shut up already!

00:21:15.030 --> 00:21:16.500
What are you doing here?

00:21:17.690 --> 00:21:20.460
A little while ago, Kujira sent me a text

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:23.460
saying he'd tell me the truth.

00:21:23.460 --> 00:21:25.560
Huh? What does that mean?

00:21:25.560 --> 00:21:27.240
We can talk at the office.

00:21:27.790 --> 00:21:28.840
Let's head back.

00:21:28.840 --> 00:21:31.850
I'm surprised you knew where I'd be.

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:34.190
Moyo said you might be here.

00:21:34.190 --> 00:21:37.600
You know, I have really sharp senses.

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:39.690
And when it comes to you, Cecil,

00:21:39.690 --> 00:21:41.870
I know all about you.

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:48.480
The catalyst will no longer be human.

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:54.460
By using the catalyst as an offering,
we'll be able to control Lucifer's power.

00:22:03.470 --> 00:22:04.580
It's Shizumu.

00:22:05.210 --> 00:22:06.760
Have SAT on standby.

00:22:07.810 --> 00:22:09.040
We're going in.

00:22:25.710 --> 00:22:33.010
Tears may drench the skies of my heart,

00:22:25.710 --> 00:22:33.010
kokoro no sora ni namida afuretemo

00:22:33.010 --> 00:22:40.380
but I still want to behold the blue outside

00:22:33.010 --> 00:22:40.380
hitomi ni aozora utsushiteitai

00:22:40.380 --> 00:22:47.770
I want to have something like the strength of flowers

00:22:40.380 --> 00:22:47.770
concrete-iro no machi no katasumi ni

00:22:47.770 --> 00:22:55.190
which bloom in the nooks of the endless concrete of the city

00:22:47.770 --> 00:22:55.190
sotto saku hana no tsuyosa wo manetai

00:22:55.190 --> 00:23:02.700
Starting today, I won't try to wriggle out by saying

00:22:55.190 --> 00:23:02.700
maegami ga jama de mienai nante iiwake

00:23:02.700 --> 00:23:06.950
that I saw nothing because my hair was in the way

00:23:02.700 --> 00:23:06.950
kyou kara shinai

00:23:07.360 --> 00:23:14.870
Beyond the horizon, my future awaits me,

00:23:07.360 --> 00:23:14.870
chiheisen no mukou ni ashita ga matteru kara

00:23:14.870 --> 00:23:20.080
so I will let the sun in my heart

00:23:14.870 --> 00:23:20.080
kono mune mou hitotsu no taiyou

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:22.130
shine out far and wide

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:22.130
tooku hanatte

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:29.510
I will overtake the earth's rotation on the path I walk,

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:29.510
chikyuu no jiten wo oikosu kurai hitamuki ni arukou

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:37.740
with trusting love inside my heart

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:37.740
shinjiru omoi dakishimete doko made mo
